IDEAS

zoxide - https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide
Copyright 2020 Ajeet D'Souza. MIT License.
Breakfast's food ranking takes its idea from zoxide's "frecency" ranking,
which scores by how often and how recently something was used. No zoxide
code is included; the formula is Breakfast's own.


